abstract: >-
  BenchCAD is a suite of three benchmarks (Vision2Code, CodeEdit, QA) that
  evaluate large language and multimodal models on procedural 3D CAD code
  understanding and generation. Tasks are graded by execution-grounded,
  objective metrics (voxel IoU between STEP solids; symmetric ratio accuracy on
  numeric answers) with no LLM judge in the loop.
